according to CoreLogic.

00:10:51.870 --> 00:10:55.170
But that's down from about 14% increases

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:57.600
at the same time in 2022.

00:10:57.600 --> 00:11:00.960
All US metros in the CoreLogic
survey posted an increase

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:02.520
