as those rates stay high,

00:11:19.560 --> 00:11:22.020
landlords, owners are
going to have to pay more

00:11:22.020 --> 00:11:25.230
and they're gonna pass that
cost on to tenants, renters,

00:11:25.230 --> 00:11:26.063
et cetera, et cetera.

00:11:26.063 --> 00:11:28.410
And so we could start to
see those rental prices

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:30.000
